### Specialized instruction files

**File: `.github/instructions/vega-lite-accessibility.instructions.md`**

```markdown
---
applyTo: "**/*.{js,ts,json}"
description: "Vega-Lite accessibility implementation guidelines"
---

## Mandatory Accessibility Implementation

### Alt Text Generation
Always include descriptive text using Amy Cesal's formula:
"Chart type of [data type] where [reason for chart]"

Example implementation:
```json
{
  "description": "Bar chart of quarterly sales data where Q4 shows highest revenue at $2.1M",
  "encoding": {
    "description": {
      "field": "quarter",
      "type": "nominal"
    }
  }
}                                         